        <mxCell id="e42" value="G · terraform apply" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;arcSize=12;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#687078;fontColor=#687078;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5906976744186047;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cbapply" target="deploys">
          <mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e43" value="H · task image pull" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;arcSize=12;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#687078;fontColor=#687078;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ecr" target="vpce">
          <mxGeometry x="-0.011" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="752" y="1174" />
              <mxPoint x="972" y="1174" />
            </Array>
            <mxPoint as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_new" value="&lt;b&gt;Services&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Media Service&lt;/b&gt; (Lambda): issues the presigned upload policy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Experience Service&lt;/b&gt; (Lambda): creates posts and tags their images as claimed. DELETE is owner only and removes the post, its images and its like counter.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reactions Service&lt;/b&gt; (Lambda, sync): like and unlike. Checks the post exists, then makes one conditional write of the like row.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Counter Lambda&lt;/b&gt; (async): reads the Likes stream in batches and updates each post's counter once per batch. A marker in the same transaction prevents double counting.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reconciliation Lambda&lt;/b&gt; (weekly): recounts likes and repairs any drift in the counters.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Moderation Service&lt;/b&gt; (Lambda, async): triggered by the Experiences stream on new posts. Checks magic bytes, calls Rekognition, and writes only when a post is flagged.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Dead-letter queue&lt;/b&gt;: on any failure the Lambda sends the experienceId to SQS. An alarm fires when the queue is not empty, and a manual redrive re-runs moderation for exactly those posts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Feed Service&lt;/b&gt; (ECS Fargate): returns the feed page with likeCount and likedByMe, and accepts ?author=me (userId GSI)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#0972D3;fillColor=#F2F8FD;" vertex="1" parent="cloud">
          <mxGeometry x="25" y="620" width="440" height="440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#AAB7B8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="200" y="1590" width="420" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg0" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="222" y="1642" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="280" y="1642" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lgt0" value="Request flow (numbers follow one request)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="292" y="1633" width="320" height="18" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg1" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="222" y="1666" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="280" y="1666" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lgt1" value="Async, attachment or manual step" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="292" y="1657" width="320" height="18" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg2" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#687078;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="222" y="1690" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="280" y="1690" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lgt2" value="Build and deploy flow (letters A to H)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="292" y="1681" width="320" height="18" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_data" value="&lt;b&gt;Data rules (keep the feed index cold)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• A post item is written at creation, takedown and delete. Never for likes or moderation results.&lt;br&gt;• A like is one conditional write to the Likes table. It never writes to the Experiences table.&lt;br&gt;• Counts are derived. The Counter Lambda nets each stream batch and updates LikeCounters once per post.&lt;br&gt;• Counts may lag by about 2 seconds. Feed Service never shows fewer than 1 like to a user who liked the post.&lt;br&gt;• Deleting a post removes its counter. Its like rows are left in place and are never read.&lt;br&gt;• Takedown removes &lt;b&gt;Type&lt;/b&gt; and sets &lt;b&gt;removed&lt;/b&gt;: the post leaves the feed GSI but its author still sees it through the userId GSI.&lt;br&gt;• Feed GSI: Type (month) + CreatedAt.&lt;br&gt;• Author GSI: userId + CreatedAt.&lt;br&gt;• If moderation fails, the post stays visible until the queue is worked." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#C925D1;fillColor=#FDF5FE;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="640" y="1590" width="1040" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_sec" value="&lt;b&gt;Security and networking&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• WAF sits on CloudFront (HTTP APIs cannot take a Web ACL). Raise the rate limit so likes do not trip it.&lt;br&gt;• API Gateway verifies the Cognito JWT on every /api/* route before any Lambda or ECS code runs.&lt;br&gt;• Both buckets are private (OAC). Uploads use a presigned POST and are tagged pending, then claimed.&lt;br&gt;• All Lambdas run outside the VPC. Fargate has no internet path and reaches AWS only through VPC endpoints.&lt;br&gt;• /api/feed is uncached at every layer." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#DD344C;fillColor=#FEF6F7;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="1590" width="990" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>